---
import Base from "../../../layouts/Base.astro";
const effectiveDate = "May 1, 2026";
const lastUpdated = "May 1, 2026";
---

<Base title="Privacy Policy | GoDoDaytona" subtitle="How GoDoCity LLC collects, uses, and protects your information when you use GoDoDaytona.com." cityBase="daytona">
  <div class="lgWrap">

    <nav class="lgBread" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/daytona/">Home</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true">›</span>
      <a href="/daytona/legal/">Legal</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true">›</span>
      <span>Privacy Policy</span>
    </nav>

    <span class="lgEyebrow">GoDoDaytona</span>
    <h1 class="lgTitle">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <div class="lgMeta">
      <span>Effective: {effectiveDate}</span>
      <span>Last Updated: {lastUpdated}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="lgDivider"></div>

    <div class="lgNotice">
      <p>We do not sell your personal information. This policy explains what we collect, why we collect it, and how you can control it.</p>
    </div>

    <nav class="lgToc" aria-label="Table of contents">
      <p class="lgTocTitle">Contents</p>
      <ol class="lgTocList">
        <li><a href="#collect">1. Information We Collect</a></li>
        <li><a href="#use">2. How We Use Your Information</a></li>
        <li><a href="#share">3. Information We Share</a></li>
        <li><a href="#cookies">4. Cookies & Tracking</a></li>
        <li><a href="#email">5. Email Communications</a></li>
        <li><a href="#retention">6. Data Retention</a></li>
        <li><a href="#rights">7. Your Rights & Choices</a></li>
        <li><a href="#security">8. Security</a></li>
        <li><a href="#children">9. Children's Privacy</a></li>
        <li><a href="#california">10. California Privacy Rights (CCPA)</a></li>
        <li><a href="#changes">11. Changes to This Policy</a></li>
        <li><a href="#contact">12. Contact</a></li>
      </ol>
    </nav>

    <div class="lgSection" id="collect">
      <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <h3>Automatically Collected Information</h3>
      <p>When you visit GoDoDaytona.com, our servers and analytics tools automatically collect: IP address, browser type and version, operating system, referring URL, pages visited, time spent on pages, device type, and screen resolution. This data is used in aggregate to understand how readers use our site and to improve the Service.</p>
      <h3>Information You Provide</h3>
      <p>We collect information you voluntarily give us, including:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Newsletter signup:</strong> email address and, optionally, first name.</li>
        <li><strong>Contact and advertiser inquiry forms:</strong> name, email address, business name, and the content of your message.</li>
        <li><strong>Contest and sweepstakes entries:</strong> name, email, and any additional entry requirements stated in the relevant Official Rules.</li>
        <li><strong>Community submissions:</strong> tips, story ideas, event listings, letters to the editor, and any other content you choose to submit.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="lgSection" id="use">
      <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>We use the information we collect to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Deliver our newsletter and editorial content.</li>
        <li>Respond to inquiries, advertiser requests, and community submissions.</li>
        <li>Improve the Service and analyze usage patterns.</li>
        <li>Administer contests, sweepstakes, and giveaways.</li>
        <li>Send transactional emails directly related to your requests (e.g., contest confirmation).</li>
        <li>Comply with our legal obligations.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not use your information to build individual advertising profiles for third-party sale. We do not sell your personal information.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="lgSection" id="share">
      <h2>3. Information We Share</h2>
      <p>We share your information only in these limited circumstances:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Service providers:</strong> We work with third-party tools and vendors — including email delivery platforms, web analytics services, and hosting providers — that process data on our behalf under contractual data processing terms.</li>
        <li><strong>Legal compliance:</strong> We may disclose information when required by law, subpoena, or court order, or when we believe disclosure is necessary to protect the rights, property, or safety of our users or the public.</li>
        <li><strong>Business transfers:</strong> If GoDoCity LLC undergoes a merger, acquisition, or asset sale, your information may be transferred as part of that transaction. We will notify you of any such change and any choices you may have before it occurs.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not share your email address or personal information with third-party advertisers.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="lgSection" id="cookies">
      <h2>4. Cookies & Tracking</h2>
      <p>We use cookies and similar tracking technologies to maintain session state, remember your preferences, understand how visitors navigate our site, and measure advertising effectiveness.</p>
      <h3>Types of Cookies We Use</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Essential cookies:</strong> Required for the site to function. Cannot be disabled.</li>
        <li><strong>Analytics cookies:</strong> Help us understand site usage in aggregate. We use Google Analytics.</li>
        <li><strong>Advertising cookies:</strong> May be set by third-party advertisers displayed on our site.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>You can disable cookies in your browser settings. Note that some features may not function correctly without cookies. To opt out of Google Analytics tracking, visit: <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="noopener noreferrer">tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout</a></p>
    </div>

    <div class="lgSection" id="email">
      <h2>5. Email Communications</h2>
      <p>If you subscribe to the GoDoDaytona newsletter, you will receive regular emails containing local news, event coverage, guides, business spotlights, and advertising. You may unsubscribe at any time by clicking the "Unsubscribe" link in any email, or by emailing <a href="mailto:hello@gododaytona.com">hello@gododaytona.com</a> with "Unsubscribe" in the subject line.</p>
      <p>Transactional emails related to contest entries, advertiser accounts, or direct inquiries are sent only as necessary to complete your request and are not subject to unsubscribe.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="lgSection" id="retention">
      <h2>6. Data Retention</h2>
      <p>We retain your email address for as long as your subscription is active. Contact form submissions are retained for up to 24 months. If you unsubscribe, we retain a record of the unsubscribe action to prevent re-enrollment.</p>
      <p>Analytics data is retained in accordance with our analytics provider's applicable policies.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="lgSection" id="rights">
      <h2>7. Your Rights & Choices</h2>
      <p>Depending on your location, you may have the right to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Access a copy of the personal information we hold about you.</li>
        <li>Request correction of inaccurate or incomplete information.</li>
        <li>Request deletion of your personal information.</li>
        <li>Object to or request restriction of certain uses of your data.</li>
        <li>Withdraw consent where processing is based on consent.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>To exercise any of these rights, email <a href="mailto:hello@gododaytona.com">hello@gododaytona.com</a> with the subject line "Privacy Request." We will respond within 30 days.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="lgSection" id="security">
      <h2>8. Security</h2>
      <p>We take reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect your information from unauthorized access, loss, or disclosure. Our site uses HTTPS encryption for all data in transit. However, no method of transmission over the internet is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee the absolute security of your data.</p>
      <p>In the event of a data breach that affects your personal information, we will notify you in accordance with applicable law.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="lgSection" id="children">
      <h2>9. Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>GoDoDaytona.com is a general-audience publication and is not directed to children under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If you believe that a child under 13 has provided personal information to us, please contact us immediately at <a href="mailto:hello@gododaytona.com">hello@gododaytona.com</a> and we will take steps to delete that information promptly.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="lgSection" id="california">
      <h2>10. California Privacy Rights (CCPA)</h2>
      <p>If you are a California resident, the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA) gives you certain rights, including:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Right to Know:</strong> You may request information about the personal data we collect, use, and disclose.</li>
        <li><strong>Right to Delete:</strong> You may request deletion of your personal information, subject to certain exceptions.</li>
        <li><strong>Right to Opt Out of Sale:</strong> We do not sell personal information. No opt-out is required.</li>
        <li><strong>Right to Non-Discrimination:</strong> We will not discriminate against you for exercising your CCPA rights.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>To exercise your California rights, email <a href="mailto:hello@gododaytona.com">hello@gododaytona.com</a> with "California Privacy Request" in the subject line.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="lgSection" id="changes">
      <h2>11. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices or applicable law. We will notify you of significant changes by updating the "Last Updated" date at the top of this page and, where appropriate, by email to our newsletter subscribers.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="lgSection" id="contact">
      <h2>12. Contact</h2>
      <p>Privacy questions, requests, and concerns:</p>
      <p><strong>GoDoCity LLC — Privacy</strong><br>Daytona Beach, FL<br><a href="mailto:hello@gododaytona.com">hello@gododaytona.com</a></p>
    </div>

  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .lgWrap { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 56px 2rem 96px; }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .lgWrap { padding: 40px 1.25rem 72px; } }
  .lgBread { font-size: 13px; color: #888; margin-bottom: 32px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .lgBread a { color: var(--brand1, #0077be); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; }
  .lgBread a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .lgBread span[aria-hidden] { color: #ccc; }
  .lgEyebrow { display: block; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--brand1, #0077be); margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .lgTitle { font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 42px); font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -0.025em; color: #111; margin: 0 0 16px; line-height: 1.1; }
  .lgMeta { font-size: 13px; color: #888; margin-bottom: 28px; display: flex; gap: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .lgDivider { height: 1px; background: #e5e7eb; margin: 0 0 32px; }
  .lgNotice { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand1, #0077be) 6%, white); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand1, #0077be) 20%, transparent); border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 32px; }
  .lgNotice p { margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.65; color: #333; }
  .lgToc { background: #f9f9fb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px 24px; margin-bottom: 52px; }
  .lgTocTitle { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #888; margin: 0 0 14px; }
  .lgTocList { list-style: decimal; padding-left: 18px; margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 7px; }
  .lgTocList a { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #333; text-decoration: none; }
  .lgTocList a:hover { color: var(--brand1, #0077be); text-decoration: underline; }
  .lgSection { margin-bottom: 52px; }
  .lgSection h2 { font-size: clamp(17px, 2.5vw, 21px); font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -0.01em; color: #111; margin: 0 0 18px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--brand1, #0077be); }
  .lgSection h3 { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; color: #111; margin: 22px 0 8px; }
  .lgSection p { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.78; color: #444; margin: 0 0 14px; }
  .lgSection p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .lgSection ul, .lgSection ol { padding-left: 22px; margin: 0 0 16px; }
  .lgSection li { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.72; color: #444; margin-bottom: 7px; }
  .lgSection a { color: var(--brand1, #0077be); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 2px; }
  .lgSection strong { color: #111; }
  @media print { .lgWrap { padding: 0; } .lgBread { display: none; } }
</style>
